icated total number of persons with ALS\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Once an ALS case is identified, the patient remains a case until confirmed deceased through the National Death Index.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Prevalence per 100,000 population using the 2015 U.S. Census estimate\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}